<title>UK: Hypo-Bank sets NZ$100 million two-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank sets NZ$100 million two-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hypo-Bank and Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    10.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.875   PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/A+    DENOMS (K) =	 SALE LIMITS US/GB/NZ/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.875</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
